{'symbol': 'CL', 'date': '2023-01-12 16:35:00', 'title': 'COLGATE DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF COLGATE-PALMOLIVE COMPANY (NYSE:CL) TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.47 PER COMMON SHARE, PAYABLE ON FEBRUARY 14, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JANUARY 23, 2023. THE COMPANY HAS PAID UNINTERRUPTED DIVIDENDS ON ITS COMMON STOCK SINCE 1895.'}